UNUserNotificationCenter: a request replaces the pending one with its identifier (unique work named and tagged with the identifier under a SkipUI prefix); every request saves its date, now when it has no trigger; work that earlier versions tagged with the bare identifier is cancelled by id on add and removal, and only NotificationWorker's work is ever cancelled; removal cancels an identifier's work whatever its saved date; pending requests are the queued notification work; removing all cancels every notification's work. Proposed upstream.

